Package: a5px
Title: Read GeoTIFF and Cloud-Optimised GeoTIFF Rasters as A5 Cells
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hugh", "Graham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hugh@belian.earth"),
    person("belian.earth", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Rust-backed reader that aggregates raster pixels directly into
    A5 pentagonal discrete-global-grid cells. Streams GeoTIFF / Cloud-Optimised
    GeoTIFF data via async-tiff and object_store, projects pixel centres to
    WGS 84 with proj4rs, and accumulates per-cell statistics (mean, sum, count,
    min, max). Designed to keep large rasters out of memory and skip the vector
    polygonisation step in classical zonal-statistics pipelines.
